  ('inf-f04123b0', 'Ilya Shapiro', 'leader', 'bft', 'pro', NULL, 'Independent', 'Media & Publishing', 'Media & Content; Public Policy', 'Journalist; Academic', 'Manhattan Institute, City Journal, Substack', NULL, 'x.com/ilyashapiro', 'Director of constitutional studies and senior fellow at the Manhattan Institute (same institutional home as Christopher Rufo and Josh Appel, both in this database), contributing editor at City Journal. Board of fellows, Jewish Policy Center. Testified before the New York Advisory Committee to the U.S. Commission on Civil Rights on "Discrimination Against Jews on College and University Campuses Since Oct. 7, 2023": "the heart of antisemitism in America lies on campus." Wrote on Berkeley Law student groups amending bylaws to permanently exclude pro-Israel/Zionist speakers. Spoke at a Republican Jewish Coalition event on "The Crisis in Higher Education." Spotlighted in John Hood''s "New Faces" FreeCon piece.', 'manhattan.institute, ilyashapiro.substack.com, rjchq.org, city-journal.org, freedomconservatism.org', NULL, NULL),
  ('inf-91ce659d', 'Anne Neuberger', 'leader', 'bft', 'pro', 90, NULL, 'Cybersecurity; Technology & AI', 'Entrepreneurship; AI & Technology; National Security', 'Founder/CEO', 'a16z (partner), ex-Deputy National Security Advisor for Cyber', NULL, 'x.com/anneneuberger', 'Former Deputy National Security Advisor for Cyber & Emerging Tech (Biden admin) and decade-plus NSA leader; became a full-time a16z partner leading global affairs (Jun 2026) -- a live bridge to the a16z inclusion criterion. Orthodox Jewish; grandparents were Holocaust survivors and her parents were Entebbe hostages rescued by Israeli commandos (Operation Thunderbolt). Founder of Sister to Sister (nonprofit for single Jewish mothers).', 'Wikipedia, a16z.com, State Dept, CFR', NULL, NULL),
  ('inf-5475198f', 'Kathryn (Kate) Amel', 'leader', 'bft', 'pro', 70, NULL, 'Nonprofit & Advocacy', 'Leadership', 'Executive', 'The Genesis Prize Foundation (Executive Assistant to the CEO)', 'The Genesis Prize Foundation', NULL, 'Executive Assistant to the CEO at The Genesis Prize Foundation, supporting senior leadership and overseeing complex operational functions. Previously held corporate strategy/operations leadership roles at Anchiano Therapeutics and Interleukin Genetics (HR, budgeting, board relations); earlier led program operations and grant management at The CAYL Institute and co-authored ''The New Early Childhood Professional'' (Teachers College Press). B.A. History and Political Science, Boston University; based in Boston. Genesis Prize affiliation is a strong institutional pro signal per criteria.', 'Andy-provided bio; genesisprize.org', NULL, NULL),
  ('inf-036bf71f', 'Fitzgerald Haney', 'leader', 'bft', 'pro', 80, NULL, 'Nonprofit & Advocacy; Professional Services', 'Leadership; Public Policy', 'Executive', 'The Genesis Prize Foundation (Managing Director, Latin America); fmr US Ambassador to Costa Rica', NULL, NULL, 'Former U.S. Ambassador to Costa Rica, now Managing Director for Latin America at the Genesis Prize Foundation (hits the Genesis Prize criterion). Already present in the raw LinkedIn 1st-degree connections import -- promoted here from backend to a curated entry.', 'LinkedIn (user''s 1st-degree connections export), Genesis Prize Foundation', NULL, NULL),
  ('inf-427b0f61', 'Marc Andreessen', 'leader', 'bft', 'pro', 75, NULL, 'Finance & Investment; Technology & AI', 'Entrepreneurship; Finance & Investing; AI & Technology', 'Founder/CEO; Investor', 'Andreessen Horowitz (a16z) co-founder, X', 'Ben Horowitz; Katherine Boyle; Anne Neuberger', 'x.com/andreessenmarc', 'Co-founder of a16z (hits the a16z inclusion criterion), anchor ''Tech Right'' VC firm with pro-West orientation; hired Anne Neuberger as global-affairs partner. Publicly aligned with the pro-growth, anti-woke, pro-West coalition. Added on team-alignment + institutional grounds.', 'Public record, a16z.com', NULL, NULL),
  ('inf-da2154ed', 'Nicholas Thompson', 'leader', 'bft', 'neutral', 50, NULL, 'Media & Publishing', 'Media & Content; Leadership', 'Founder/CEO; Author', 'The Atlantic (CEO)', NULL, NULL, 'Andy 18 Jul 2026: CEO of The Atlantic; co-founder; author (''The Running Ground''); ~1.6M LinkedIn followers. Andy''s read: a MODERATE DEMOCRAT and a ''common-sense, NON-PUBLIC Zionist'' -- sympathetic but not vocal about it. | Andy 20 Jul: JD Vance LinkedIn post re: The Atlantic (linkedin.com/posts/...activity-7483638651373981696) -- track the Vance-vs-Atlantic dynamic.', 'Public record', NULL, NULL),
  ('inf-280464e0', 'Elon Musk', 'leader', 'bft', 'yellowflag', 55, NULL, 'Technology & AI', 'AI & Technology; Marketing & Branding', 'Executive', 'X (owner), Tesla/SpaceX, massive social reach', NULL, 'x.com/elonmusk', 'YELLOW FLAG -- genuinely mixed. Nov 2023: publicly endorsed an antisemitic ''great replacement''-adjacent post, triggering a major advertiser/ADL crisis. Then visited Israel and Auschwitz (with Ben Shapiro), condemned antisemitism, and has platformed pro-Israel voices; but also reinstated banned accounts and drew a Jan 2025 gesture controversy. Consequential and often supportive, but not a clean ally -- monitor.', 'Public record (2023-2026)', NULL, NULL),
  ('inf-81d4254a', 'Larry Ellison', 'leader', 'bft', 'pro', 95, NULL, 'Technology & AI; Defense & NatSec', 'Entrepreneurship; AI & Technology; National Security', 'Founder/CEO', 'Oracle (founder/CTO), philanthropy', 'Stephen Schwarzman', 'x.com/larryellison', 'Oracle founder (company already tracked in Businesses tab); historically the largest private donor to Friends of the IDF; close personal relationship with PM Netanyahu; drove Oracle''s Jerusalem data center. Family now controls Paramount/CBS through son David Ellison -- arguably the most strategically significant pro-Israel family in American business and media.', 'Times of Israel, JTA, public record', NULL, NULL),
  ('inf-b09e3324', 'David Ellison', 'leader', 'bft', 'pro', 80, NULL, 'Media & Publishing', 'Entrepreneurship; Media & Content', 'Founder/CEO; Journalist', 'Paramount Skydance (CEO)', NULL, 'x.com/david_ellison', 'CEO of Paramount Skydance after the 2025 merger; installed Bari Weiss as CBS News editor-in-chief and acquired her Free Press for $150M -- the single largest pro-Israel-aligned realignment of a legacy US news network in memory. NOTE: user wrote "David Edison"; entered as David Ellison per context (Larry Ellison + CBS in the same request) -- flag if a different person was intended.', 'Variety, Status News, public record', NULL, NULL),
  ('inf-2e8b0812', 'Erica Mindel', 'leader', 'bft', 'pro', 85, NULL, 'Defense & NatSec', 'National Security; Public Policy', 'Executive', 'TikTok (Public Policy Manager, Hate Speech)', NULL, 'jpost.com/diaspora/article-862765', 'TikTok''s Public Policy Manager for hate speech since Jul 2025 -- ex-IDF (Armored Corps + Spokesperson''s Unit), self-described proud Zionist, tasked with combating a reported 912% rise in antisemitic content on the platform since Oct 2023. Previously supported Special Envoy Deborah Lipstadt''s antisemitism office at the State Department and served at AJC. A strategically vital inside-the-platform ally.', 'Jerusalem Post, JFeed, Jewish News UK', NULL, NULL),
  ('inf-5a34dcda', 'Gary Vaynerchuk', 'leader', 'bft', 'pro', 75, NULL, 'Professional Services', 'Entrepreneurship', 'Founder/CEO', 'VaynerMedia (CEO), massive social presence', NULL, 'x.com/gvaynerchuk', 'VaynerMedia founder/CEO and one of the most-followed business personalities on earth; Jewish immigrant (family left Soviet Belarus); has spoken against antisemitism post-Oct 7. Silent-majority principle applies to his largely apolitical content -- his identity and statements when made are the signal.', 'Public record', NULL, NULL),
  ('inf-4220bd8a', 'David Meltzer', 'leader', 'bft', 'pro', 60, NULL, 'Professional Services', 'Entrepreneurship; Marketing & Branding; Media & Content', 'Founder/CEO', 'Speaking/podcasts (co-founder Sports 1 Marketing)', NULL, 'x.com/davidmeltzer', 'Sports-marketing executive (co-founded Sports 1 Marketing with Warren Moon; former Leigh Steinberg COO) and prolific motivational-business personality; Jewish and publicly proud of it. Silent-majority principle applies.', 'Public record', NULL, NULL),
  ('inf-168d499c', 'Tim Dunn', 'leader', 'bft', 'pro', 85, NULL, 'Energy', 'Entrepreneurship', 'Founder/CEO', 'CrownQuest Operating / CrownRock LP (CEO); IAF Christian Advisory Board (Chairman)', 'Israel Allies Foundation, CrownQuest Operating', 'x.com/timdunn', 'Chairman of the Israel Allies Foundation Christian Advisory Board; co-founder/CEO of oil & gas firm CrownQuest Operating (and CrownRock LP) and a major conservative philanthropist. Also #41 on IAF''s 2025 Top 50 Christian Allies. His companies added to Businesses tab per ally-org rule.', 'Israel Allies Foundation (Christian Advisory Board); IAF Top 50 2025', NULL, NULL),
